==International relations==
Calatayud is classified as an [[w:Global city|Alpha+ World City]], according to the [[<>]] group's (GaWC) 2018 inventory. It has consistently ranked as one of the world's most liveable cities.

The city also hosts the headquarters of the [[Hydocardian Space Agency]], the arm of the [[Hydocardian Council]] that deals with aerospace research.
